    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer, Strategize, and Save from the Dangers of Chilling Fog!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master simple yet addictive gameplay: drag to send troops, conquer houses, and outwit enemies trying to destroy your forces. As you progress, unlock <i>movable heroes</i> that change the game with powerful abilities and unique playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade troops and heroes to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect chests, uncover rare items, and equip your heroes through the inventory system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills across 40+ challenging levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong><br>In the realm of Eldoria, a sinister fog blankets the land, corrupting everything in its path. Ancient prophecies foretell a rising evil, and brave villagers must rise to defend their homes. Unite, strategize, and lead them to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the community!</strong><br>Share feedback, suggest new features, and shape the future of this game and upcoming titles on our Discord channel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle for Eldoria awaits\u2014are you ready to lead?</p>",
